cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Sparse Readout Prism, please cite the paper."
type: software
title: "Sparse Readout Prism"
abstract: >-
  Sparse Readout Prism decomposes a language model's readout (the
  unembedding matrix) using only its weights, expressing any token logit
  or logit difference as a sum of signed contributions from sparse readout
  features plus an explicit residual, with fidelity diagnostics reported
  for every decomposition.
